        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel of silk satin damask, France, 1700-1710"@en , "Panel of silk satin damask. White satin and yellow reverse with a design of large tilted vases. Out of these and around them curl stems of flowers woven in pale pink, pale green, deep pink, lilac, white and pale blue silk, in bands bound on the back, with lime green silk for leaves and outlines. Pattern weft is used throughout. The design is bound on the surface in 1/3 twill."@en ;
